# Enterprise Lender Ecosystem — Live Data Protection (CO-LENDER-ECOSYSTEM-001)

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Priority: **P0** · Scope: Lender Ecosystem activation

## Principle

Existing Enterprise Lender Ecosystem data is **LIVE BUSINESS DATA**.

Activation must **never** destroy, reset, or rewrite existing records merely to make development easier.

## Forbidden (without explicit Product Owner written approval)

- Delete / truncate / reset / re-seed / overwrite / recreate / rename / hard-delete existing:
  - Lenders · Lending Programs · Products · Product↔Lender mappings
  - Lender contacts · Lender documents · Policies · Document checklists
- Orphan foreign keys or corrupt IDs
- Production Reset, Soft Go-Live bootstrap, Tier-2 seed, baseline program seed, LR-010 `--apply`, or `co-lender-activate-operational --apply` as part of “activation”
- Using localStorage or in-memory stores as the **source of truth** when `ENTERPRISE_PERSISTENCE_MODE=prisma`

## Required

- Schema changes via **additive migrations** only
- Preserve existing IDs and relationships
- Soft-delete only for user-removed contacts/documents (never hard-delete live lenders/programs for activation)
- Persist mappings through Enterprise Registries (Prisma)

